{"id":"00175","root":"uni00175_1","name":{"ja":"黄泉　秋津","en":"Yomi Akitsu"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"黄泉　秋津","en":"Yomi Akitsu"},"element":"Devilish","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":"2019-03-31","limited":false,"characterId":139,"profile":{"ja":"魔界に住まう人間族。かつて魔界にくだった忍者の末裔で“魎魔忍（りょうまにん）”と呼ばれている。当然、長い年月をかけて魔界に適応しており、普通の人間より遥かに優れた能力を有す。その一つは魔装具と呼ばれる魔法の力を宿した甲冑。秋津の魔装具“蜘蛛夜叉”は彼女の意思に従って自在に動く四つの多関節脚が特徴で彼女は自らの両腕と４つの多関節脚で刀を揮う六刀流剣術の達人。魔界において魔族同士の勢力争いが激化すると魎魔忍たちはその間隙をぬって挙兵、人間界にも勢力拡大を目論んでいる。忍者の末裔であるため当然、対魔忍の様に忍法を使うものも存在し、忍法と魔装具の力を有する彼らは大変危険な存在である。","en":"(Yomi Akitsu, she/her) A human-type who lives in the Demon Realm. She is a descendant of the ninjas who once descended into the Demon Realm and is called a \"Ryoma-nin.\" Naturally, she has adapted to the Demon Realm over many years and possesses abilities far superior to ordinary humans. One such ability is her magical armor, a \"magical equipment\" infused with sorcery. Akitsu's magical equipment \"Spider Yaksha\" features four multi-joint legs that move freely at her will, allowing her to wield a six-blade sword style with both arms and the four legs. As power struggles among demons intensify, the Ryoma-nin seize the opportunity to rebel and aim to expand their influence into the Human Realm. Being ninja descendants, some of them also use ninjutsu like the Taimanin, making those who combine ninjutsu with magical equipment extremely dangerous."},"illustrator":"なまにくATK","voiceActor":"木多野あり","forms":[{"id":"uni00175_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1098,2196],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[191,382],"def":[128,256],"spd":[74,74],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":41,"skills":["2","150004"]},{"id":"uni00175_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1596,3192],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[307,614],"def":[181,362],"spd":[74,74],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":41,"skills":["2","150004","150005"]},{"id":"uni00175_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","levelMax":100,"stats":{"hp":[2094,